#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "*WebTunnel* bridges"
msgstr "Ponts *WebTunnel*"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"You can now use *WebTunnel* bridges to connect to the Tor network from "
"Tails."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez maintenant utiliser des ponts *WebTunnel* pour vous connecter au "
"réseau Tor depuis Tails."

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"[*WebTunnel*](https://blog.torproject.org/introducing-webtunnel-evading-censorship-by-hiding-in-plain-sight/)  "
"is a bridge technology that is particularly good at circumventing censorship "
"and might work from places where *obfs4* bridges are blocked. *WebTunnel* "
"disguises your connection as ordinary web traffic."
msgstr ""
"[*WebTunnel*](https://blog.torproject.org/"
"introducing-webtunnel-evading-censorship-by-hiding-in-plain-sight/)  est une "
"technologie de pont particulièrement efficace pour contourner la censure et "
"peut fonctionner depuis des lieux où les ponts *obfs4* sont bloqués. "
"*WebTunnel* masque votre connexion derrière un trafic web classique."

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"To get *WebTunnel* bridges, visit "
"[https://bridges.torproject.org/](https://bridges.torproject.org/bridges?transport=webtunnel)."
msgstr ""
"Pour obtenir des ponts *WebTunnel*, consultez [https://bridges.torproject."
"org/](https://bridges.torproject.org/bridges?transport=webtunnel)."

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[[!img webtunnel.png class=\"screenshot\" alt=\"\"]]\n"
msgstr "[[!img webtunnel.png class=\"screenshot\" alt=\"\"]]\n"

